{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】神舟二十四號載人飛行任務即將於周三升空，中國太空站首次迎來外籍航天員，現時準備工作進入最後倒數階段，今次升空有甚麼看點？</p>\n<p>周二的《時事全方位》，請來專家解讀。</p>\n<p>題目：神廿四即將升空</p>\n<p>熱線電話：1833298</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:54:29.024904+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:30:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:57:23.490807+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:48:01.298186+00:00","content_hash":"b63159e26de6f91358dc5b1cf0c26e7c785df87c5abc16b0747cdc56450e60b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}